<div class="media-wrapper"><img decoding="async" src="https://cdn.macstories.net/images/uploads/2026/10/13/apple-tv-4k-home-theater-setup-261013-1791901111900-e674b62c5d.jpg" alt="Source: Apple."><p class="image-caption">Source: Apple.</p></div>
<p id="p2">Apple also <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/10/apple-unveils-the-new-apple-tv-4k/" rel="noopener noreferrer">updated the Apple TV 4K today</a>. Last updated in 2022, the Apple TV 4K’s fourth-generation update is focused on bringing an improved surround sound experience to the Apple TV, along with Siri AI. From the outside, the new Apple TV 4K looks like the old one: a nondescript black box that sits under your TV, but on the inside, the components have been upgraded. The Siri Remote has been updated too.</p>
<div class="media-wrapper"><img decoding="async" src="https://cdn.macstories.net/images/uploads/2026/10/13/apple-tv-4k-with-siri-ai-suggestions-261013-1791901105864-88c6946406.jpg" alt="Source: Apple."><p class="image-caption">Source: Apple.</p></div>
<p id="p4">The updated Apple TV features Apple’s A19 chip with an AV1 decoder and three far-field microphones. The A19 chip has a faster CPU (a claimed 50% boost) and GPU (a claimed 2x improvement), which may come in handy when playing games. The microphones allow a user’s voice to be picked up by the Apple TV despite background noise, and Apple says Siri AI will enable new ways to discover what to watch on the device. It’s worth noting that Siri AI is available on the second- and third-generation Apple TV 4K, too. Other upgraded specs that are notable include Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6.</p>
<div class="media-wrapper"><img decoding="async" src="https://cdn.macstories.net/images/uploads/2026/10/13/apple-tv-4k-siri-remote-precision-finding-261013-1791901108417-8880462ed4.jpg" alt="Source: Apple."><p class="image-caption">Source: Apple.</p></div>
<p id="p6">Apple has also expanded the surround sound capabilities of the Apple TV. It can now be paired with four Apple HomePod mini 2s or second-generation HomePods or two pairs of each HomePod type. As for the Siri Remote, it now supports Precision Finding and can play a sound when used with the Find My app.</p>
<p id="p7">The new Apple TV 4K is a steep $299, which is disappointing but understandable given the update and 128GB of storage and <a href="https://www.apple.com/shop/buy-tv/apple-tv-4k" rel="noopener noreferrer">can be preordered now</a> in the U.S. and 29 other countries, with delivery and in-store availability on November 13.</p>
